          "settings": {
            "subheading": "- Unlock Your Putting Potential-",
            "heading": "Customized for Precision and Performance",
            "textarea": "When it comes to golf, every stroke counts, and the putter is a key weapon in your arsenal. That's why customizing your golf putter, right from the factory, can make all the difference in your game. By BUILDING the putter to your specific needs and preferences, you can enhance your precision, control, and overall performance on the green.\n\nCustomization options often include length, lie, grip style, etc...\nbut only T SQUARED PUTTERS offers dozens of additional design options like adding accent colors, names, team or business logos, personal messages and numerous alignment aid options.\n\nWhether you're a seasoned pro or a recreational golfer, investing in a customized putter ensures that it becomes an extension of your playing style, providing you with the confidence and consistency needed to sink those crucial putts. Don't settle for a one-size-fits-all approach—unleash your putting potential through personalized customization and elevate your golf game to new heights.",
            "cta_text1": "Shop Putters",
